  "source_code": "t=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=sorted(map(int,input().split()),reverse=True)\r\n    p=[0]\r\n    for x in a:\r\n        p.append(p[-1]+x)\r\n    ans=0\r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        l,r=0,n-x\r\n        while l<=r:\r\n            m=(l+r)//2\r\n            j=x+2*m\r\n            k=3*n-2*x-m\r\n            if m<n-x and a[j]+a[j+1]>3 *a[k-1]:\r\n                l=m+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                r=m-1\r\n        for m in range(max(0,l-1),min(n-x,l+1)+1):\r\n            j=x+2*m\r\n            k=3*n-2*x-m\r\n            ans=max(ans,2*p[x]+p[j]+3*p[k])\r\n    print(ans)",
